		(uuid "d631dbde-522d-442c-b412-e59b539d86c1")
	)
	(text_box "When using a single pulser channel A, disconnect all three signals (IN, EN and OUT) between channels A and B. Moreover, pull PULSER_IN_B to ground for the lowest power consumption."
